EMI not paid? What happens on day 1, day 30, day 31 and day 91 of a missed home loan EMI, by RBI rules: bounce charge, recovery agent calls (only 8 AM to 7 PM), CIBIL score drop, NPA.
Full video: {MAIN_URL}
#emi #homeloan #cibilscore #loan #rbi

Your dad never borrowed a rupee, but he signed as your loan guarantor. If you stop paying your EMI, the bank can go straight to him, and his CIBIL score falls too (Indian Contract Act, s.128).
Full video: {MAIN_URL}
#emi #loanguarantor #cibilscore #homeloan #loan
